<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's Unibanco cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's Unibanco cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings said it had cut its rating for Brazil's Unibanco to hold from sell.</p>
<p>-- In a Jan 16 report, analyst Petru Vaduva wrote, &quot;Unibanco's stock price has declined 14 percent since our initiation of coverage. Valuation has reached a more sustainable level and is in line with its Brazilian peers.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 1.60 to 32.95 in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
